sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client (Web App)
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant SVC as Support Microservice
    participant AI as ChatBot Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant TICKET as Ticket Service (Internal)

    U->>C: Open Chat Window
    C->>API: POST /support/chat/start
    API->>SVC: Create Chat Session
    SVC->>DB: Insert Chat Record
    DB-->>SVC: Chat ID Returned
    SVC-->>API: Response (Chat Session Started)
    API-->>C: Chat Window Ready

    U->>C: "I can’t access simulation"
    C->>API: POST /support/chat/message
    API->>SVC: Forward Message
    SVC->>AI: Send Message to NLP Engine
    AI-->>SVC: AI Response + Confidence Score
    SVC->>DB: Save ChatMessage (user + assistant)
    alt Confidence < 0.5
        SVC->>TICKET: Create Support Ticket (Escalation)
        TICKET-->>SVC: Ticket ID Returned
    end
    SVC-->>API: Return Chat Response
    API-->>C: Display AI or Escalation Message